  "goodToKnow": "Die Lizenz is a licence: eine Softwarelizenz, die Trainerlizenz, in Lizenz hergestellt (made under licence). Note the spelling with z twice and the stress on the second syllable. A driving licence is not a Lizenz but der Führerschein, and a fishing licence is der Angelschein. In German football, clubs need a Lizenz from the DFL to play in the Bundesliga. Lizenzfrei means licence-free."
